{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.PhiDSytCountConjecture","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.PhiDSytCountConjecture","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":28,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.defaultGeneralPhiD4F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.defaultGeneralPhiD4F","kind":"instance","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L221-L227","doc":"Canonical instance of the general conjecture. Currently\ndischarged trivially (the map IS `4·f` by definition); the\nsubstantive content is the **predictive accuracy** at each\n`(n, λ)` instance, which is the open R&D content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_map_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_map_eq","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L216-L216","doc":"The conjectural identity: `d_lambda_map(f) = 4 · f`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_map","kind":"def","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L214-L214","doc":"The cyclotomic-order map `λ ↦ 4 · f_λ` as a function of the\npartition SYT count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L211-L211","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GeneralPhiD4FConjecture","kind":"class","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L207-L216","doc":"**General-n cyclotomic-factor conjecture** axiomatised as a\nclass. Per-`(n, λ)` instances supply the predicted `Φ_{d_λ}`\nfactor and prove agreement with the empirical character\ndifference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.sign_irrep_q_factor_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.sign_irrep_q_factor_identity","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L185-L190","doc":"For the **sign 1-d irrep** (V_(1^n)), the analogous identity\nwith `−q⁻¹` substitution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.trivial_irrep_q_factor_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.trivial_irrep_q_factor_identity","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L176-L183","doc":"For the **trivial 1-d irrep** (V_(n) at n=3), the Hecke generator\nacts as `q`. The character difference involves `(q - q⁻¹)²` and\n`(q + q⁻¹)²` factors, whose product yields the Φ_4(q) = q² + 1\ncyclotomic factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phi_d_at_one_dim_irrep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phi_d_at_one_dim_irrep","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L162-L167","doc":"For any 1-d irrep (where $f_λ = 1$), the conjecture predicts\n`d_λ = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V111","kind":"instance","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L143-L149","doc":"V_(1,1,1) instance: f_(1,1,1) = 1, d_(1,1,1) = 4 — verified via\nchi_V111_numerator_matches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V21","kind":"instance","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L134-L140","doc":"V_(2,1) instance: f_(2,1) = 2, d_(2,1) = 8 — verified via\nchi_V21_numerator_matches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phiDConj_V3","kind":"instance","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L125-L131","doc":"V_(3) instance: f_(3) = 1, d_(3) = 4 — verified via\nchi_V3_numerator_matches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.conjecture_residual_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.conjecture_residual_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L120-L120","doc":"The conjecture residual vanishes (closed form matches prediction). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.conjecture_residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.conjecture_residual","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L118-L118","doc":"Residual scalar capturing the conjecture's predictive accuracy\nat substrate q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_eq_four_f","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda_eq_four_f","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L115-L115","doc":"The hypothesis `d_λ = 4 · f_λ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.d_lambda","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L113-L113","doc":"The cyclotomic order index `d_λ = 4 · f_λ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L111-L111","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiD4FConjecture","kind":"class","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L109-L120","doc":"**Per-irrep cyclotomic-factor conjecture** axiomatised for\narbitrary $\\lambda \\vdash n$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_numerator_matches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_numerator_matches","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L96-L101","doc":"The V_(1,1,1) numerator from the conjecture matches the proved\nclosed-form numerator `-(q² − 1)(q² + 1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_numerator_matches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_numerator_matches","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L89-L94","doc":"The V_(2,1) numerator from the conjecture matches the proved\nclosed-form numerator `-(q² − 1)(q⁴ + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_numerator_matches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_numerator_matches","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L82-L87","doc":"The V_(3) numerator from the conjecture matches the proved\nclosed-form numerator `-(q² − 1)(q² + 1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_numerator_conjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_numerator_conjecture","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L75-L78","doc":"V_(1,1,1) numerator predicted by the conjecture:\n`-(q² − 1) · Φ_4(q)²` with `4 · f_(1,1,1) = 4` and multiplicity 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_numerator_conjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_numerator_conjecture","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L70-L73","doc":"V_(2,1) numerator predicted by the conjecture:\n`-(q² − 1) · Φ_8(q)¹` with `4 · f_(2,1) = 8` and multiplicity 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_numerator_conjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_numerator_conjecture","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L65-L68","doc":"V_(3) numerator predicted by the conjecture:\n`-(q² − 1) · Φ_4(q)²` with `4 · f_(3) = 4` and multiplicity 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_111","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L60-L61","doc":"The SYT count for λ = (1,1,1): `f_(1,1,1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_21","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L57-L58","doc":"The SYT count for λ = (2,1): `f_(2,1) = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.syt_count_3","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L54-L55","doc":"The SYT count for λ = (3): `f_(3) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_Phi8","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_Phi8","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L51-L52","doc":"The cyclotomic polynomial Φ_8(q) = q⁴ + 1 (degree 4). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_Phi4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cyclotomic_Phi4","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/phi-d-syt-count-conjecture.lean#L48-L49","doc":"The cyclotomic polynomial Φ_4(q) = q² + 1 (degree 2). ","signatureChunk":0}]}